  "Description": {
    "Cost": 8023311,
    "UIName": "Parakeet",
    "Id": "chassisdef_parakeet_PRK-1O",
    "Name": "Parakeet",
    "Details": "The PRK-10 is a 15-ton ultralight built entirely around stealth and reconnaissance. A Chameleon Light Polarization Shield spans six critical slots across the entire frame for visual concealment while a Guardian ECM Suite handles sensor masking. Head-mounted TAG and Remote Sensor Dispenser enable artillery spotting and forward sensor networks. An ER Medium Laser handles light threats and a Flamer deters infantry. Three tons of Ferro-Fibrous armor and an XL Gyro keep mass minimal for maximum speed.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Advanced Optics</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.99</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_parakeet"
  },
  "VariantName": "PRK-1O",
  "ChassisTags": {
    "items": [
      "Squad",
      "MechSquad",
      "UsesAmmoSameLocationOnly"
    ]
  },
  "StockRole": "Ultralight Scout",
  "YangsThoughts": "Clan Diamond Shark built these out of their Twycross factory after they rebuilt it. Ultralight scout, fifteen tons, not meant to fight anything seriously. Lyran Alliance bought most of them and mercenaries liked them too because they're cheap enough to risk losing. That Chameleon Light Polarization Shield is Star League era tech which is a nice touch for something this small. Don't let anyone shoot at it though.",
